{
  "version": 1,
  "actions": [
    {
      "_note": "入参必须先 op:set 落地成 data 域的键,方法参数里才看得见(§9.5 #3)。`.xwidget` 不传 → 空串 → 归 0 → 全程不碰缓存。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cacheIn",
        "value": "${_cache}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "useCache",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(${cacheIn},0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "**结构版本号**:pack 的字段集变了就 +1。它管的不是「数据新不新」而是「这份数据的**形状**还认不认」——缓存键只含对象维度、不含包代际,不盖这个戳,升级后首屏就会拿上一版的 pack 去渲新模板:少的字段取空,尺寸串里的 calc 一算 null,**整卡白块且不报错**。\n⚠️ 从 1 起、绝不能用 0(`eq::(空,0)` 恒为 true,旧缓存会被判成匹配)。⚠️ 刻意不用 `manifest.version`:flow 拿不到,且那会过度失效(只改配色也丢全部缓存)。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "SCHEMA",
        "value": "3"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "缓存键。⚠️ 凡是影响结果的入参都要进键,且**绝不能用下标**(下标随增删漂移,漂移后会把 A 的数据渲成 B 的,还不报错)。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ckey",
        "value": "$[connect::(c.hn.story.,${id})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "读缓存。`default:{}` 让下面的 ${hit.ts} 在无缓存时安全取空,而不是整条流断掉。",
      "id": "hit",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "${ckey}",
        "default": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "hitSchema",
        "value": "${hit.schema}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nowMs",
        "value": "${@time.nowMs}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "hitTs",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(${hit.ts},0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "age",
        "value": "$[calc::(${nowMs}-${hitTs})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "两道闸:**结构比对**(pack 形状对不上就当没有缓存 —— 旧形状渲新模板是白块,比等一次网络糟得多)+ hardTTL = 86400s(太旧的数先渲出来再改口,不如老实等一次)。嵌套 if 而不是 and:: —— `and` 不在确认可用的方法集里。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "hasHit",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${hitSchema},${SCHEMA}),if::(gt::(${hitTs},0),if::(lt::(${age},86400000),1,0),0),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "ttl = 300s(§5.5.3)。纯新鲜度,不掺 useCache —— 掺进去 `_stale` 就算不对了。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "fresh",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(${hitTs},0),if::(lt::(${age},300000),1,0),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "「这次先出的是旧货,请后台校新」。**必须进 resultFilter** —— 校新那条路靠它,漏了就是永不校新。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_stale",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${useCache},1),if::(eq::(${hasHit},1),if::(eq::(${fresh},1),0,1),0),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "只有「开了缓存 且 有没超 hardTTL 的货」才跳过网络 —— 连接都不建立。⚠️ **stale 也走这条跳过**(首屏零等待是三态的全部价值);写成「不 fresh 就打」= 退回两态,首屏照样白等。卡片(useCache=0)与冷启一律落进 items 真取数。",
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(eq::(${useCache},1),if::(eq::(${hasHit},1),0,1),1)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "_note": "单条详情。**刻意不透传评论树**:children 是 7 层嵌套、几百 KB,且每个评论对象都带着一堆对本页无用的 null 字段(title/url/points —— 评论不是 story)。详情页的职责是「这条是什么 + 去哪读」,评论交给 HN 讨论页本身(点『在 HN 上讨论』就到,那里的评论体验本来就更好)。",
          "id": "resp",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://hn.algolia.com/api/v1/items/${id}",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "json"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "title",
            "value": "${resp.title}"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "author",
            "value": "${resp.author}"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "points",
            "value": "${resp.points}"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "createdAt",
            "value": "$[subString::(${resp.created_at},0,10)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "nComments",
            "value": "$[length::(${resp.children})]"
          }
        },
        {
          "_note": "Ask HN / Show HN 这类帖子没有外链(url 为 null),此时「阅读原文」按钮该隐藏 —— 给个空串让页面自己判。",
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "url",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp.url},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "host",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp.url},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "_note": "帖子正文(Ask HN / Show HN 的 text,HTML 片段;外链帖恒为 null)。⚠️ 刻意不走 $[findNotEmpty::…] —— 正文里有逗号/括号,过方法参数解析器会被切碎;null 由页面侧判掉(render 里过滤 \"null\")。",
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "body",
            "value": "${resp.text}"
          }
        },
        {
          "_note": "HN 讨论页恒为 news.ycombinator.com/item?id=<id>。这是给用户点的外链(容器把它当下一页 push、不注入桥),不发请求,故不进 manifest.network。",
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "hnUrl",
            "value": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=${id}"
          }
        },
        {
          "_note": "评论(2026-09-22 用户要求详情页有内容):只挑**前 20 条顶层评论 + 每条前 2 条回复**,每条只留 作者/正文/时间 + 直接回复数 n(顶层另带 id,供「在 HN 上看这条」) —— 整棵树 7 层几百 KB,不整份透传。⚠️ Algolia children 是**按时间**排的不是 HN 的排名,页面侧按 n(直接回复数)重排作热度近似。越界下标取空,页面按「作者或正文为空」滤掉(已删除的评论同理)。正文是 HN 的 HTML 片段,带逗号括号,故只走直取不过方法。",
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "comments",
            "value": [
              {
                "a": "${resp.children[0].author}",
                "t": "${resp.children[0].text}",
                "at": "${resp.children[0].created_at_i}",
                "n": "$[length::(${resp.children[0].children})]",
                "r": [
                  {
                    "a": "${resp.children[0].children[0].author}",
                    "t": "${resp.children[0].children[0].text}",
                    "at": "${resp.children[0].children[0].created_at_i}"
                  },
                  {
                    "a": "${resp.children[0].children[1].author}",
                    "t": "${resp.children[0].children[1].text}",
                    "at": "${resp.children[0].children[1].created_at_i}"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "${resp.children[0].id}"
              },
              {
                "a": "${resp.children[1].author}",
                "t": "${resp.children[1].text}",
                "at": "${resp.children[1].created_at_i}",
                "n": "$[length::(${resp.children[1].children})]",
                "r": [
                  {
                    "a": "${resp.children[1].children[0].author}",
                    "t": "${resp.children[1].children[0].text}",
                    "at": "${resp.children[1].children[0].created_at_i}"
                  },
                  {
                    "a": "${resp.children[1].children[1].author}",
                    "t": "${resp.children[1].children[1].text}",
                    "at": "${resp.children[1].children[1].created_at_i}"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "${resp.children[1].id}"
              },
              {
                "a": "${resp.children[2].author}",
                "t": "${resp.children[2].text}",
                "at": "${resp.children[2].created_at_i}",
                "n": "$[length::(${resp.children[2].children})]",
                "r": [
                  {
                    "a": "${resp.children[2].children[0].author}",
                    "t": "${resp.children[2].children[0].text}",
                    "at": "${resp.children[2].children[0].created_at_i}"
                  },
                  {
                    "a": "${resp.children[2].children[1].author}",
                    "t": "${resp.children[2].children[1].text}",
                    "at": "${resp.children[2].children[1].created_at_i}"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "${resp.children[2].id}"
              },
              {
                "a": "${resp.children[3].author}",
                "t": "${resp.children[3].text}",
                "at": "${resp.children[3].created_at_i}",
                "n": "$[length::(${resp.children[3].children})]",
                "r": [
                  {
                    "a": "${resp.children[3].children[0].author}",
                    "t": "${resp.children[3].children[0].text}",
                    "at": "${resp.children[3].children[0].created_at_i}"
                  },
                  {
                    "a": "${resp.children[3].children[1].author}",
                    "t": "${resp.children[3].children[1].text}",
                    "at": "${resp.children[3].children[1].created_at_i}"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "${resp.children[3].id}"
              },
              {
                "a": "${resp.children[4].author}",
                "t": "${resp.children[4].text}",
                "at": "${resp.children[4].created_at_i}",
                "n": "$[length::(${resp.children[4].children})]",
                "r": [
                  {
                    "a": "${resp.children[4].children[0].author}",
                    "t": "${resp.children[4].children[0].text}",
                    "at": "${resp.children[4].children[0].created_at_i}"
                  },
                  {
                    "a": "${resp.children[4].children[1].author}",
                    "t": "${resp.children[4].children[1].text}",
                    "at": "${resp.children[4].children[1].created_at_i}"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "${resp.children[4].id}"
              },
              {
                "a": "${resp.children[5].author}",
                "t": "${resp.children[5].text}",
                "at": "${resp.children[5].created_at_i}",
                "n": "$[length::(${resp.children[5].children})]",
                "r": [
                  {
                    "a": "${resp.children[5].children[0].author}",
                    "t": "${resp.children[5].children[0].text}",
                    "at": "${resp.children[5].children[0].created_at_i}"
                  },
                  {
                    "a": "${resp.children[5].children[1].author}",
                    "t": "${resp.children[5].children[1].text}",
                    "at": "${resp.children[5].children[1].created_at_i}"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "${resp.children[5].id}"
              },
              {
                "a": "${resp.children[6].author}",
                "t": "${resp.children[6].text}",
                "at": "${resp.children[6].created_at_i}",
                "n": "$[length::(${resp.children[6].children})]",
                "r": [
                  {
                    "a": "${resp.children[6].children[0].author}",
                    "t": "${resp.children[6].children[0].text}",
                    "at": "${resp.children[6].children[0].created_at_i}"
                  },
                  {
                    "a": "${resp.children[6].children[1].author}",
